{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51722","headline":"题驿门（禹卿会後主东游，上表极谏，及後主被诛，禹卿痛哭，题诗于驿门而遁。雍守捕之，禹卿已还蜀矣。） · 蒲禹卿","name":"题驿门（禹卿会後主东游，上表极谏，及後主被诛，禹卿痛哭，题诗于驿门而遁。雍守捕之，禹卿已还蜀矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我王衔璧远称臣，何事全家幷杀身。\n汉舍子婴名尚在，魏封刘禅事独新。\n非干大国浑无识，都是中原未有人。\n独向长安尽惆怅，力微何路报君亲。\n（《监诫录》七《陪臣谏》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒲禹卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}